BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yolo Prostate Cancer Support Group (Davis)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T210000
UID:380aa4245775f541ab58dd0491b53cc5@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:The Yolo Prostate Cancer Support Group invites men\, their spo
 uses and family members to meet with prostate cancer survivors to learn ab
 out treatment options. Participants benefit from candid discussions about 
 experiences with disease management and progression\, imaging studies\, me
 dical and surgical procedures\, recovery\, and side effects. Attendance an
 d informative handout materials\, as available\, are free of charge.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/15484003
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
